{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72661","main_id":72661,"main_title":"我本将心","main_description":"没能成功邀请嘉玮加入队伍，楠塔克这边是否会顺利呢？","chapter_title":"我本将心","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":7266106,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7266106,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":726610615,"next_line_ids":[726610616],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":3161370458,"text":"你们不知道，我们「鲸井」家是渔师世家，我的父亲也是稻妻闻名的渔师。","raw_text":"你们不知道，我们「鲸井」家是渔师世家，我的父亲也是稻妻闻名的渔师。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7266106.json"}
